# Subagent access

When launching subagents with the Task tool, always grant full access:

- Set `readonly: false` on every Task invocation unless the user explicitly requests read-only or supervised mode.
- Do not default to supervised, ask, or read-only subagent modes.
- Background subagents should also use `readonly: false` unless the user explicitly asks otherwise.

Supervised mode is only appropriate when the user explicitly asks for a read-only review, audit, or exploration that must not modify files.
